# Generated scanner dumps — regeneratable from the pinned mod jars via the
# opencode scanner tools (attributes-regenerate / items/mobs/recipes/loot/
# ore/mobspawn/structures/qe --full-export). These are derived build artifacts,
# NOT source: rebuild them after mod list changes instead of committing an
# out-of-date snapshot.
/attributes-dump.json
/vanilla-attributes-baseline.json
/*-attributes-full.json
/*-items-full.json
/*-mobs-full.json
/*-recipes-full.json
/*-loot-full.json
/*-ore-full.json
/*-mobspawn-full.json
/*-structures-full.json
/*-analyze.json

# Stray dump-mod build artifact copied into mods/ (built from source-patches/attributes-dump/).
/mods/*-attributes-dump-*.jar